skip psql_gp_commands  differs: psql 19's \dx has a Default version column, and Cloudberry's psql describes its storage and external tables in its own way
run  dropdb_check_shared_buffer_cache
skip gp_upgrade_cornercases  cannot drop schema public because other objects depend on it: the database it makes is template1's copy, where gp_setup made gp_orca and gp_inject_fault in schema public
skip temp_relation  differs: a temporary table's file is t<proc number>_<relfilenode> in PostgreSQL 19, and the test looks for Cloudberry's t_<relfilenode>, which it finds on no node, before DROP TABLE and after
run  oid_wraparound
skip gangsize  differs: the gangs its statements are dispatched to, by Cloudberry's INFO lines, are not the sizes Cloudberry makes them
run  gang_reuse
run  create_extension_fail
skip aqumv  unrecognized configuration parameter "enable_answer_query_using_materialized_views"; unrecognized parameter namespace "gp"
